# event.pal - page_1's real top-level script - Show Choices dispatch
# macOS leg 2026-08-22: this line used to hardcode a Linux dev-box
# absolute path (/home/no/Desktop/...) - silently no-op'd on any other
# machine (prisc exec failed, halt exited 0, zero output). The exec
# opcode already resolves relative targets against g_pal_dir (this
# .pal's own directory, set from argv[1]'s realpath), so a plain
# ./dispatch.sh points at the SAME file on Linux and is portable.
exec ./dispatch.sh
halt
